<title>ESTONIA: Estonian May CPI two pct mo/mo, 10.8 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Estonian May CPI two pct mo/mo, 10.8 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian consumer prices rose by two percent on a month-on-month basis in May for a year-on-year inflation rate of 10.8 percent, the country's statistics office said on Friday.</p>
<p>    ESTONIAN CPI		May 1997  April 97   May 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)    2.0     1.9	  0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)     10.8     9.2	 26.7</p>
<p> Index (1993 = 100)	     260.2   255.0	234.8</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
